# PRD — "Protect Toiture" Single-Page Roofing Website (Pixel-Faithful Recreation)

## 0. RULES FOR THE AI BUILDER (READ FIRST)
1. **Always try updating/editing existing files first. Rewrite a whole file only when really necessary. Avoid repeated full rewrites.**
2. Recreate the website exactly as described: same layout, same spacing feel, same colors, same animations. Do not simplify or skip any animation.
3. Build it as a polished, production-quality single-page site (one-page scroll with anchor navigation).
4. All visible website text stays in **French**, exactly as written in this document.
5. Fully responsive (desktop 1920 → tablet → mobile 375). Desktop design is described below; adapt sensibly for smaller screens.
6. Stack (mandatory): **React (Vite) + Tailwind CSS + Framer Motion**. Icons: lucide-react. Fonts via Google Fonts (see 2.6 and 2.7). Build every section as its own React component (see section 8 for structure). Put all colors and fonts in `tailwind.config.js` + CSS variables so they can be changed in one place.

