## 1. Project Overview
- **Business:** Protect Toiture — roofer (couvreur) in Ardèche, France. Domain style: protecttoiture.fr
- **Goal:** Lead generation. Every section pushes the visitor to click **"Devis Gratuit"**, call, or submit the callback form.
- **Tone:** Trustworthy local artisan, modern, clean, premium. Lots of social proof (4.9/5 Google, 200+ clients, 10-year guarantee).
- **Page type:** One page, sections in this order: Top bar → Header → Hero → Stats → Services → Réalisations (Avant/Après) → Engagements → Avis → FAQ → Contact → CTA band + Footer.

