## 3. Global Behaviors
- **Smooth scrolling** to anchors; offset for sticky header.
- **Scroll progress bar:** thin (2–3px) orange bar at very top of the header that grows left→right with page scroll.
- **Active nav highlighting:** the nav link of the section currently in view turns orange and shows a small orange underline beneath it (animated sliding underline between links).
- **Reveal-on-scroll:** every section heading, card, stat and form block fades in + slides up (24–40px, 0.6–0.8s, ease-out), cards staggered by 100–150ms.
- **Custom cursor ripple:** on click/hover over nav links and buttons, a soft orange circular ripple (≈30px, fading) appears at the pointer position (visible in the video on nav hover/click).
- Links `tel:+33623838816`, `mailto:protectoiture74@gmail.com`; WhatsApp-style link may open an external app (optional).

